{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>它分享了一幅可能由人工智能生成的圖片，畫面是一個雕有墨西哥帽的南瓜。</p>\n<p>它為圖片配上字幕：「鬼怪季節到啦。」</p>\n<p>這則帖文似乎是在引用Donald Trump及其他共和黨人去年分享的墨西哥帽主題人工智能短片；當時他們就移民問題抨擊民主黨。</p>\n<img alt=\"Donald Trump and first lady Melania Trump greet trick-or-treaters at the White House in 2020.\" src=\"https://img.huffingtonpost.com/asset/6ae2e830180000ccba250faa.jpeg?cache=0DQS5wvMlD&amp;ops=scalefit_720_noupscale\"/>\n<p>那些短片畫有多位 prominent 民主黨議員戴上墨西哥帽，廣受譴責，被指帶有種族主義色彩。</p>\n<p>白宮的萬聖節版本亦引起批評者以諷刺回應，其中一些人不僅利用人工智能製作自己的南瓜雕刻，還把總統及其長期盟友、已故性犯罪者Jeffrey Epstein刻在上面。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T22:41:38.536544+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":683,"images":1,"source":"HuffPost 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T06:56:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T00:58:12.034391+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T22:38:18.104775+00:00","content_hash":"2e4327c7182e47cc04c718f242dcc48bc99dc98bdc38efa1c888ca80cedf412a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T22:41:38.536544+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}